,{"client_msg_id":"3e39c3cf-0e8f-4af4-96c5-7e4fd6d848bf","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"(SandE はもう使ってないけど)","ts":"1624172997.241600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NuA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"322e07c7-733f-4cf1-a78f-447fc3ddd824","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"僕は CandS (Ctrl and Space) とか SandE (Shift and Enter) 使ってますが、慣れです","ts":"1624172982.241200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"G4t"}]},{"client_msg_id":"FE361C8E-E3AB-4B9E-A95E-69FCC772391B","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"筋肉に送る電気信号を一瞬だけ遅らせればいいので、最初はかなりイラッとするんですけど、あんがい1週間くらいで慣れます。","ts":"1624172959.240400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["U776661HA"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NlD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f968a06c-3813-46e4-b4e2-859c9d19a0b8","type":"message","user":"U022TD5GGKE","text":"（それです）","ts":"1624172883.238100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":1,"users":["UAZ33BKV2"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Han"}]},{"client_msg_id":"13178bcb-6a93-4726-b296-dee9e0534170","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"(ちがう)","ts":"1624172844.237500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XwfJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6c1bacea-5000-41bb-b123-4c908b52752c","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"metaキー扱い多いからねw","ts":"1624172841.237300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"km4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8d4af0db-c133-4439-bb2f-79cda9a0e943","type":"message","user":"U022TD5GGKE","text":"altキーがね、もうメタメタなんですよ。","ts":"1624172816.236300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"N7m"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b1ccf919-d197-4af5-8379-b3ecbff4b8da","type":"message","user":"U022TD5GGKE","text":"`-` がalt-\\-扱いになってしまうとか、 `p` がalt-p（コマンドヒストリ検索）になった辺りで肉体改造が頭をよぎった。","ts":"1624172796.235600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"06OGZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"aa028c4c-f973-4916-ad50-26f7c329a561","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"なので、僕の場合は SandS を取るか肉体改造するかを迫られて、肉体改造を選んだということですね","ts":"1624172619.233200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"+1smile","count":5,"users":["UG6DF6W87","U76V658V6","U022TD5GGKE","U776661HA","U81LLJ340"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uamP9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"98205170-3fc3-4ff1-b607-8c3e899542ed","type":"message","user":"U022TD5GGKE","text":"\u0026gt; 押し下げ中に次のキーを入力\nまさにこれですねー。意識してタイピングすれば意図した通りに打てています。","ts":"1624172567.232300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MHTBP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ea9d0c1b-0fd2-417c-9558-a093cfdb437f","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"たしか、Karabiner-Element の前身の KeyRemap4MacBook のときの SandS はスペースが入るのが早くて問題なかったのですが、macOS の仕様変更にともない Karabiner-Element になってスペースが入るまで一瞬待ちが発生するようになった記憶が甦ってきました。","ts":"1624172523.231900","edited":{"user":"UFHQ7TNT0","ts":"1624172539.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1wA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"71fd77f7-2234-461a-8374-8e0f1c246196","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"SandS 系統は肉体改造が必要....","ts":"1624172495.231100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"JA7Z"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2138a927-f9e9-432b-b9eb-edb8bb11a95f","type":"message","user":"U022TD5GGKE","text":"ともやさんは人体キーボード、まで読んだ。","ts":"1624172387.228100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"fuita","count":3,"users":["UFHQ7TNT0","U776661HA","U01J7703PFT"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DUu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"17d8e4b3-93d0-42d7-9720-0930ad4ce0f5","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"スペースがAltになるということは、押し下げ中に次のキーを入力してしまっているということですよね。\nもう記憶の彼方ですが、僕もかつてそれで困ったけど、身体に慣らしてなんとかしたような気もします。スペースを入れるときは、押し上げるまで一瞬だけ待つみたいな。","ts":"1624172309.227300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"WeK9W"}]},{"client_msg_id":"335b0f36-5475-49dc-9d86-2e092b8be75b","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"あら、SandS で特に不都合を感じたことないんですが、何か違うのかな","ts":"1624172104.224700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"eyes","count":1,"users":["U022TD5GGKE"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2ST"}]},{"client_msg_id":"da81be7d-7295-481e-8153-dc1c1357c032","type":"message","user":"U022TD5GGKE","text":"正確にはKarabiner-elementsだとしきい値をうまく調整できなかった。という感じでした。うまくいくと思ったんだがなあ","ts":"1624172038.223800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Y4MQL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c4bdcf36-a6d6-4c8b-839a-d49c7bb74786","type":"message","user":"U022TD5GGKE","text":"`Space and Alt`を使って半日、早めにタイピングするとスペースがaltになる問題が解消されず、お流れになりそう。。","ts":"1624171826.221800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pZlDt"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b3670840-3760-4011-b683-f9c4a57aca34","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"iPad Pro も入力しておきました\n\u003chttps://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1vUESrzhaE6XKfyAazD5E82qSMkDnfMXq_YOv2S0_-2o/edit#gid=534345052\u003e","ts":"1624171112.220300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"spin_keizai","count":3,"users":["U022TD5GGKE","U01J7703PFT","U017BU3UZBQ"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"OxI"}]},{"type":"message","user":"U025Z1